  "summary": "Annotate legacy getter and signing functions that return a boolean success flag alongside mutable out-parameters with the C++17 `[[nodiscard]]` attribute across the codebase. Address callers that previously ignored the return value by asserting success in witness sigop counting, checking descriptor cache return status, and wrapping test iteration in `BOOST_REQUIRE`.",
